              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sean"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Dry mustard was a bad choice. Using Dijon mustard instead made the salmon great. This recipe leaves an after taste that’s not pleasing. I don’t rate foods low but this was an exception. Do try the Dijon mustard instead. You’ll be pleased with the results!",
